@startuml View folder files flow
title View folder files flow

actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Metadata Service" as Metadata
database "Metadata DB" as MetadataDB
participant "Permission Service" as Permission
database "Permission DB" as PermissionDB

User -> App : Open app / folder

App -> Gateway : GET /folders/{folder_id}/files
Gateway -> Auth : Validate token
Auth --> Gateway : user_id

Gateway -> Metadata : Get files in folder\nuser_id, folder_id

Metadata -> MetadataDB : Find files and subfolders\nby folder_id
MetadataDB --> Metadata : files metadata

Metadata -> Permission : Filter accessible files\nuser_id, file_ids
Permission -> PermissionDB : Check permissions
PermissionDB --> Permission : allowed file_ids and\npermissions for files
Permission --> Metadata : allowed file_ids and\npermissions for files

Metadata -> Metadata : Return accessible \nfiles/folders and\npermissions for files

Metadata --> Gateway : files and folders list and\npermissions for files
Gateway --> App : files and folders list and\npermissions for files

App --> User : Display files and folders and\nallowed actions for them

@enduml